{"unit_id":"173787247__dsh-wsl-open#feature-1","repo":"173787247/dsh-wsl-open","commit":"8e578bad20efb0a7aa28a107527ef1f8396eb4d5","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-wsl-open 的功能「识别并高亮路径」：插件扫描助手消息中的 Linux 绝对路径并添加点状下划线；点击路径时提交该路径和当前会话标识，由主机端继续处理。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:9-25","client.js:53-65","client.js:211-224"]}
